secubox-security-posture (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Full rewrite — honest, board-truthful posture scorecard (closes #617).
  * Replaces the broken v1: /overview NameError, ~95% stubbed TPN, hardcoded
    performance/DEFCON values and the zip()/gather() CSPN misalignment bug.
  * New posture/ engine: pure scoring (DEFCON dial), real provenance-tracked
    collectors over public sibling sockets + CrowdSec Prometheus + /proc.
  * Indicators grouped by the six SecuBox module-domains; unmeasurable signals
    render UNKNOWN/MANUAL and are excluded from the score, never faked.
  * Repaired CSPN backbone; real TPN media overlay (anti-piracy DNS, TLS).
  * New shared hybrid-skin dark UI; sidebar menu.d entry (folds #616).
  * Unit tests for scoring, CSPN parsers and collector normalization.
  * Drop python3-psutil; add python3-uvicorn. Standards-Version 4.6.2.

 -- Gerald Kerma <devel@cybermind.fr>  Mon, 16 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0200

secubox-security-posture (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of SecuBox Security Posture module
  * DEFCON-level security health monitoring (1-5)
  * CSPN compliance checking (ANSSI certification alignment)
  * TPN Media compliance checking (media industry standards)
  * Performance monitoring with bottleneck detection
  * Combined security dashboard API
  * REST API endpoints for all security posture data

